## absent → the boot lays it
SET
   (rc 0)

## same → the boot keeps it
KEEP
   (rc 0)

## another platform declared → the boot refuses
DIFFERS aws.ec2
   (rc 3)

## absent, the seat's sudo wants a password
sudo: a password is required
   (rc 1)

## the seat is unreachable
ssh: connect to host <host> port 22: Connection refused
   (rc 255)


